  "description": "Source contradiction-proof schematic: actual a parallel b and A on a/c; visible finite c ends above b. The supposition that c does not meet b is hypothetical, not an executable Euclidean fact. Semantic HOLD: retain the full proof context without asserting the refuted supposition.",
